# Pluclair

Follow `AGENTS.md` at the repository root, and the `AGENTS.md` of the folder
you are working in (`apps/web`, `apps/mobile`, `packages/core`,
`packages/data`, `supabase`). They hold the product's lines, the git flow,
the checks, and the rules for the database, copy and formatting.

- Which page shows which feature, and the code behind it: `docs/feature-map.md`.
- How it looks and moves: `apps/web/DESIGN.md` and `apps/mobile/DESIGN.md`.
  They replace the old "transparent gamified UI" rule. Arrivals fade (no
  stagger), and each design (Nuit, Papier, Bento, Console) frames its blocks
  its own way.
- Why things are the way they are: `docs/decisions/README.md`.
- Every doc and when to update it: `docs/README.md`.
